Needs the headers recipe (csp_nonce in templates). With 'strict-dynamic' in script-src a host/'self' source is ignored, so the external consent.js tag itself needs the nonce; the Google tag it creates inherits trust from it. List the first-party cookie `consent` in essentialCookies. In app/security.py extend the CSP for the analytics beacons only: connect-src 'self' https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://www.googletagmanager.com; img-src 'self' data: https://www.google-analytics.com (never put Google hosts in script-src).
