Flask 3.1 + Flask-WTF (CSRFProtect) + Flask-Limiter 4 + requests. Env: SECRET_KEY, FORM_WEBHOOK_URL, RATELIMIT_STORAGE_URI (redis://... in production: memory:// is per process and resets on restart). Behind a proxy wrap app.wsgi_app = ProxyFix(app.wsgi_app, x_for=1) or every visitor shares one rate-limit key. Call init_contact(app) in create_app() and link app/static/site.css from base.html. Success is shown only after the webhook answered 2xx; any failure or timeout is a 502. For a stronger bot check replace the honeypot with Cloudflare Turnstile (cf-turnstile-response verified server-side).
