Flask 3.1. DEPLOY_ENV and SITE_URL are read from os.environ at request time (Flask inlines nothing at build time); only DEPLOY_ENV=production means production. Call init_seo(app) in create_app(). If nginx or a CDN serves /static or answers some paths itself, add `X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow` there for non-production too. Delete any static robots.txt / sitemap.xml under static/ or the web root.
